{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"lsj_mhz_xf0","canonical_person_id":"lsj_mhz_xf0","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["lsj_mhz_xf0"],"persons":[{"id":"lsj_mhz_xf0","label":"劉胤〔建興法曹參軍〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"劉胤","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002:m0308"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002:m0308","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei","quote":"劉胤"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"劉胤〔建興法曹參軍〕，見本組原文及身份互校。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-069-liuwei-ws2012453","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-069","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002:m0308"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002:m0308","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002:m0308"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-069-liuwei-ws2012453"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei:identity2-304","kind":"identity","person_id":"lsj_mhz_xf0","source_quote":"法曹參軍劉胤","reading":"此提及據建興淳于伯案中的法曹參軍限定身份。與溫嶠薦舉及劉演之弟的同名者待證。","note":"此提及據建興淳于伯案中的法曹參軍限定身份。與溫嶠薦舉及劉演之弟的同名者待證。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002","start_codepoint":304,"end_codepoint":310,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei","source_id":"s-jinshu-069-liuwei-ws2012453"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002:m0308","surface":"劉胤","start":308,"end":310,"person_id":"lsj_mhz_xf0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-069-liuwei:p002","text":"建興中，丞相府斬督運令史淳于伯而血逆流，隗又奏曰：「古之為獄必察五聽，三槐九棘以求民情。雖明庶政，不敢折獄。死者不得復生，刑者不可復續，是以明王哀矜用刑。曹參去齊，以市獄為寄。自頃蒸荒，殺戮無度，罪同斷異，刑罰失宜。謹按行督運令史淳于伯刑血著柱，遂逆上終極柱末二丈三尺，旋復下流四尺五寸。百姓喧華，士女縱觀，咸曰其冤。伯息忠訴辭稱枉，雲伯督運訖去二月，事畢代還，無有稽乏。受賕使役，罪不及死。軍是戍軍，非為征軍，以乏軍興論，於理為枉。四年之中，供給運漕，凡諸徵發租調百役，皆有稽停，而不以軍興論，至於伯也，何獨明之？捶楚之下，無求不得，囚人畏痛，飾辭應之。理曹，國之典刑，而使忠等稱冤明時。謹按從事中郎周筵、法曹參軍劉胤、屬李匡幸荷殊寵，並登列曹，當思敦奉政道，詳法慎殺，使兆庶無枉，人不稱訴。而令伯枉同周青，冤魂哭於幽都，訴靈恨於黃泉，嗟歎甚于杞梁，血妖過於崩城，故有隕霜之人，夜哭之鬼。伯有晝見，彭生為豕，刑殺失中，妖眚並見，以古況今，其揆一也。皆由筵等不勝其任，請皆免官。」於是右將軍王導等上疏引咎，請解職。帝曰：「政刑失中，皆吾暗塞所由。尋示愧懼，思聞忠告，以補其闕。而引過求退，豈所望也！」由是導等一無所問。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":13,"last_line":13,"raw_start":893,"raw_end":1404,"raw_character_offsets":[895,896,897,898,899,900,901,902,903,904,905,906,907,908,909,910,911,912,913,914,915,916,917,918,919,920,921,922,923,924,925,926,927,928,929,930,931,932,933,934,935,936,937,938,939,940,941,942,943,944,945,946,947,948,949,950,951,952,953,954,955,956,957,958,959,960,961,962,963,964,965,966,967,968,969,970,971,972,973,974,975,976,977,978,979,980,981,982,983,984,985,